    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi náaza nchiamba, “Godzera nidziinjize kpwenye raha, nidzifurahishe.” Ela hata vivyo gaga piya tagana fwaida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchimanya kukala chitseko na kudziburudisha tavifwaha chitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Náririkana na nchiendza njira ya kudzichangamsha mwiri kpwa kunwa uchi na kuhenda mambo ga chizuzu (kuno nchere na ikima). Kala nalonda nimanye ni chitu chani chinono ambacho anadamu anaweza kuhenda, wakati anaenderera kuishi maisha gao mafupi phapha duniani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.23+1KI.10.24+1KI.10.25+1KI.10.26+1KI.10.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 10:23–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.22+2CH.9.23+2CH.9.24+2CH.9.25+2CH.9.26+2CH.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 9:22–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Náhenda mambo makulu: nádzidzengera nyumba na nchirima minda ya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nádzitengezera bustani na nchirima minda, nami nchiiphanda mihi ya matunda ga chila aina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchidzitengezera mitsara ya madzi ga kumwagira mihi mitsanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 4:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nágula atumwa alume na achetu, nchikala na atumwa ariovyalwa mwangu nyumbani, tsona nchikala na vyaa vinji vya mifugo kuriko osi arionitanguliya kuishi Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nádzikusanyira feza na zahabu na hazina kula kpwenye falume nyinji na kula kpwenye majimbo manji. Nami nchidziphahira aimbadzi alume na achetu na nchidzistarehesha na anachetu anji dza mlume yeyesi aazavyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
